# Story page: nm-maw
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: The Pit
---
The Maw closed.

There was no floor any more, only the places the floor had not yet gone. {name} fled across them, and the Hunter followed, and the dark followed the Hunter.

'This is where the coil begins,' said the coil, 'and where it ends, and it is the same place.' I looked down. I wish I hadn't. I wish I had looked down sooner.
